<div class="kicker">P4 · AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</div><h1>平台不是一次誕生，而是不斷演化</h1>
<p class="lead">台積電的技術路線圖顯示，先進製程與先進封裝將是未來數年的核心驅動力；更重要的是，四個領域開始一起演化。</p>
<div class="visual"><img src="/research-assets/ai-platform-evolution.png" alt="AI Platform Evolution Blueprint"></div>
<div class="grid three">
<article class="card"><div class="icon">01</div><h3>Advanced Process</h3><p>更先進的製程，推動晶片效能與能源效率提升。</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">02</div><h3>Manufacturing Excellence</h3><p>製造能力提升，確保良率與量產規模。</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">03</div><h3>Advanced Packaging</h3><p>先進封裝突破物理限制，整合更多功能與效能。</p></article>
<article class="card" style="grid-column:1/-1"><div class="icon">04</div><h3>AI / HPC Workloads</h3><p>AI 與高效能運算需求，驅動平台不斷進化。</p></article>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>一眼看懂</strong>No single technology builds a platform. Platforms emerge when technologies evolve together.</div>

